RDKit
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Copyright (c) 2006-2024 Rational Discovery LLC, Greg Landrum, and others
Licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License
https://github.com/rdkit/rdkit

Portions of common/chem.js are independent JavaScript implementations written
with reference to RDKit's C++ and Python sources, specifically:
  - the Ertl topological polar surface area (TPSA) contribution table and
    algorithm, following RDKit's Code/GraphMol/Descriptors/MolSurf.cpp
  - the Wildman-Crippen logP and molar refractivity atom-type definitions,
    following RDKit's Crippen parameter tables
  - the hydrogen-bond donor/acceptor and rotatable-bond SMARTS definitions
    used by RDKit's Lipinski module

No RDKit source code is copied verbatim. These implementations were validated
against RDKit's own regression data.

